This repository is published for review and evaluation. It is the working
source of an operational system built for the Siliguri Metropolitan Police
traffic branch.

You may read, clone and run this code to evaluate it. You may not deploy it in
production, offer it as a service, or use it commercially, without written
permission from SARGVISION Intelligence Pvt. Ltd.

Third-party data and services carry their own terms:

  Google Maps Platform  — Google Maps Platform Terms of Service. This software
                          caches latitude and longitude only. Travel times are
                          held in memory and never persisted. See
                          packages/network/probe.py.

  Akbar, Couture, Duranton & Storeygard, "Mobility and Congestion in Urban
  India", American Economic Review 113(4), 2023 — CC BY 4.0,
  doi:10.5281/zenodo.10499064.

  Junction volume-to-capacity ratios are from the Comprehensive Mobility Plan
  2011, published in the Siliguri City Development Plan 2041.

  Accident density figures are from Roy, Mohammadi & Roy, Geographies 6(2):55
  (2026), doi:10.3390/geographies6020055.

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. It reports
where traffic is slower than typical. It does not establish cause, and no
output of it should be treated as a finding of fact.
